.claude/audit/
.claude/settings.local.json
**/.env
**/*.pem
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
.venv-admin/
**/*.egg-info/

# editor vault + OS cruft
.obsidian/
**/.DS_Store

# developer-local egress allowlist additions (operator-controlled, machine-local, not shipped).
# The committed scaffolding (00-local.conf placeholder + overrides.conf.example) is kept;
# the developer's actual additions in overrides.conf stay local-only.
/config/allowlist.local.d/overrides.conf

# transient per-run test logs/summaries (keep canonical *-results.csv evidence)
tests/*/results/run-*.log
tests/*/results/run-profiles-*.log
tests/*/results/summary-*.txt
tests/*/results/summary-profiles-*.txt

# --- separation guard: the design record lives in AgentArca-internal, never here ---
# Operator runbooks for shipped tool features are tool artifacts, not design record
# (SPEC-29-P0 sec 7.1 places runbook-break-glass.md in this repo), so they are
# explicitly re-included below the guard.
/docs/*
!/docs/runbook-break-glass.md
!/docs/runbook-codex-device-auth.md
!/docs/runbook-onboarding.md
/specs/
/plan/
/CLAUDE.md
/AgentArca-internal/
